#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: shd-instagram-feed.php
msgid "SHD Instagram Feed"
msgstr "SHD Instagram Feed"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
#: shd-instagram-feed.php
msgid "https://www.sh-digital.ch/"
msgstr "https://www.sh-digital.ch/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: shd-instagram-feed.php
msgid "Shows your latest Instagram posts in a fast, accessible slider with an Elementor widget. Posts and images are synced in the background and stored locally, so visitors never load anything from Instagram."
msgstr "Zeigt Ihre neuesten Instagram-Beiträge in einem schnellen, barrierefreien Slider mit Elementor-Widget. Beiträge und Bilder werden im Hintergrund synchronisiert und lokal gespeichert, Besucher laden also nichts von Instagram."

#. Author of the plugin
#: shd-instagram-feed.php
msgid "SH Digital"
msgstr "SH Digital"

